{"lyrics":"[00:00.00] [Instrumental Intro]\n[Intro]\n[00:20.58] (Hit-Boy)\n[00:20.78] Oh-woah-oh\n[Chorus]\n[00:24.70] Uh, they wonder where I'll end up down the road\n[00:26.80] They tell me if I take it, then I need to take it slow\n[00:29.54] I tell 'em \"I'ma take it 'til I fuckin' overdose\" (Oh-oh, bitch)\n[00:33.34] Until I overload, until I straight explode\n[00:36.42] And since we talkin' 'bout takin', boy, these drugs take a toll (Toll, toll, toll, toll)\n[00:39.80] Uh, let 'em take control of— demons have their motives (Motives)\n[00:42.88] Demons got me like, \"Oh shit, fuck, here it go again\" (Go again)\n[00:45.98] I'm trapped in this ocean, fuck, don't know how to swim (Yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[Verse 1]\n[00:51.52] I'm so over it\n[00:53.36] No, I lied, I'm just overindulged\n[00:57.00] Oh, my, I'm exposing my soul to those that don't need to get close\n[Bridge]\n[01:02.00] I'm chasin' the dragon, tryna find the first high\n[01:05.34] The first high is the best one, the second one is the worst time\n[01:08.64] Ever, ever, ever, ever, ever\n[01:10.70] Trapped, forever, ever, ever, ever, ever\n[Chorus]\n[01:14.54] Uh, they wonder where I'll end up down the road\n[01:16.96] They tell me if I take it, then I need to take it slow\n[01:20.14] I tell 'em \"I'ma take it 'til I fuckin' overdose\" (Oh-oh, bitch)\n[01:23.44] Until I overload, until I straight explode\n[01:26.30] And since we talkin' 'bout takin', boy, these drugs take a toll (Toll, toll, toll, toll)\n[01:29.58] Uh, let 'em take control of— demons have their motives (Motives)\n[01:32.74] Demons got me like, \"Oh shit, fuck, here it go again\" (Go again)\n[01:35.94] I'm trapped in this ocean, fuck, don't know how to swim (Yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[Verse 2]\n[01:39.72] Drownin', drownin', drownin', drownin', drownin'\n[01:42.08] My head beneath water, water, water, frownin', frownin', frownin'\n[01:45.22] I'll turn upside down, down, down, smilin', smilin', smilin'\n[01:48.30] Perky in the crowd, crowd, crowd